ANCHOR
===
Germans never have occasion to use the word, because, instead of '*d* flat, *d* natural, *d* sharp,' they say 'des, de, dis,' while *b*♭, *b* ♮ are termed 'be, ha'. On older organ pipes ♭ ♮ are constantly used for *b*♭ *b*♮, and some organ-builders still use them.—*Translator*.]

